#. translators: %s: Link to author site.
#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:227
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Tax Switch for WooCommerce is developed by %s. Your trusted WordPress & "
"WooCommerce plugin partner from the Netherlands."
msgstr ""
"Btw-schakelaar voor Woocommerce is ontwikkeld door %s. Uw betrouwbare "
"WordPress & WooCommerce pluginpartner uit Nederland."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:243
msgid "Tax switch settings"
msgstr "Btw-schakelaar instellingen"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:245
msgid "Customize the tax switch settings."
msgstr "Pas de instellingen van de btw-schakelaar aan."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:249
msgid "Including tax text"
msgstr "Tekst inclusief btw"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:251
msgid "Text to append to prices including tax."
msgstr "Tekst om toe te voegen aan prijzen inclusief btw."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:256
msgid "Excluding tax text"
msgstr "Tekst exclusief btw"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:258
msgid "Text to append to prices excluding tax."
msgstr "Tekst om toe te voegen aan prijzen exclusief btw."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:271
msgid "Where enabled"
msgstr "Waar ingeschakeld"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:276
#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:281
msgid "On all pages"
msgstr "Op alle pagina's"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:277
#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:282
msgid "Only on WooCommerce pages"
msgstr "Alleen op WooCommerce-pagina's"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:278
#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:283
msgid "Only on pages displaying prices"
msgstr "Alleen op pagina's met prijzen"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:280
msgid ""
"WooCommerce pages include: product archives/categories, single product pages "
"and account pages."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce-pagina's zijn: productarchieven/categorieën, individuele "
"productpagina's en accountpagina's."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:281
msgid "On all pages where a Tax Switch block/shortcode is placed."
msgstr "Op elke pagina waar een btw-schakelaar block/shortcode is geplaatst."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:282
msgid ""
"Hidden on pages that are not part of the store. Stops rendering completely."
msgstr ""
"Verborgen op pagina's die niet onderdeel zijn van de webshop. Stopt het "
"renderen volledig."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:283
msgid ""
"Hidden on pages that do not display any prices. Renders, but hides the "
"components (slightly slower)."
msgstr ""
"Verborgen op pagina's die geen prijzen weergeven. Wordt gerenderd, maar "
"verborgen (iets langzamer)."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:284
msgid ""
"Tax Switch blocks/shortcodes are always hidden on the cart and checkout "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Btw-schakelaar blocks/shortcodes zijn altijd verborgen op de winkelwagen- en "
"afrekenpagina's."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:289
msgid "Price switching in mini cart"
msgstr "Prijs aanpassingen in de mini winkelwagen"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:291
msgid ""
"Allow customers to switch between prices including and excluding tax in the "
"default WooCommerce mini cart."
msgstr ""
"Geef klanten de mogelijkheid om te wisselen tussen prijzen inclusief en "
"exclusief btw in de standaard WooCommerce mini-winkelwagen."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:292
msgid ""
"By default, price switching is disabled in the mini cart to keep cart totals "
"consistent. After changing this setting, empty the mini cart and reload to "
"see the updated behavior (the mini cart markup is cached)."
msgstr ""
"Standaard is het omwisselen van prijzen in de mini winkelwagen uitgeschakeld "
"om de winkelwagentotalen consistent te houden. Na het wijzigen van deze "
"instelling moet je de mini-winkelwagen leegmaken en de pagina herladen om "
"het bijgewerkte gedrag te zien (de markup van de mini-winkelwagen wordt "
"gecached)."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:314
msgid "Shortcode settings"
msgstr "Shortcode instellingen"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:316
msgid "Generate a tax switch shortcode."
msgstr "Genereer een btw-schakelaar shortcode."

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "Tax Switch for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Btw-schakelaar voor Woocommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://wijnberg.dev"
msgstr "https://wijnberg.dev"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Let customers toggle between inclusive and exclusive tax pricing in your "
"WooCommerce store."
msgstr ""
"Laat klanten schakelen tussen prijzen inclusief en exclusief btw in uw "
"WooCommerce webshop."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Wijnberg Developments"
msgstr "Wijnberg Developments"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://wijnberg.dev/"
msgstr "https://wijnberg.dev/"

